    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) recently hosted a landmark summit, bringing together senior higher education regulators from Pakistan and East Africa. This gathering signals a significant step towards creating South-South collaboration aimed at strengthening quality, expanding access, and promoting more flexible academic models across these regions.",
